{"title":"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d1c3ffc61429c1e6337c2b09f8682707ec2e1f2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{1\\cdot2\\cdot4+2\\cdot4\\cdot8+\\cdots+n\\cdot2n\\cdot4n}{1\\cdot3\\cdot9+2\\cdot6\\cdot18+\\cdots+n\\cdot3n\\cdot9n}\\right)^{1/3}\\]\" width=\"327\" height=\"47\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/763c6f93ba897ae18d320ac17f0b2e1f6e5d7772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{1\\cdot2\\cdot4+2\\cdot4\\cdot8+\\cdots+n\\cdot2n\\cdot4n}{1\\cdot3\\cdot9+2\\cdot6\\cdot18+\\cdots+n\\cdot3n\\cdot9n}\\right)^{1/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"331\" height=\"47\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b774ac0881e69a57c86e16f246ac3b730e46089e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\left(\\frac{2^3\\cdot1+2^3\\cdot2^3+2^3\\cdot3^3+2^3\\cdot4^3+\\cdots+2^3n^3}{3^3+3^3\\cdot2^3+3^3\\cdot3^3+3^3\\cdot4^3+\\cdots+3^3n^3}\\right)^{1/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"417\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c109733e627761f233356b79881104eb404155bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\left[\\frac{2^3\\cancel{(1^3+2^3+3^3+\\cdots+n^3)}}{3^3\\cancel{(1^3+2^3+3^3+\\cdots+n^3)}}\\right]^{1/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -24px\" width=\"275\" height=\"63\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/6/946554044daabe3109d14d9dd199f8c3dfd1c7e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\frac{2}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"45\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO\">1975 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#16